    <main id="content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[95rem] px-4 py-8">
<div class="mb-4"><a href="/view/manga/md/s1" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-200 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg> Back to detail</a></div><div class="flex gap-4 p-4 bg-neutral-900 rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 mb-4"><img src="/image?pluginID=md&url=https://cdn.test/c.jpg" alt="" class="w-20 h-28 object-cover rounded-md border border-neutral-800"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-1">Migrating from</div><h1 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1 leading-tight">Golden Manga</h1><div class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-1">2 chapters in this entry</div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-300"></span></div></div><p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-4">Pick which source to move this entry to. Edit the query or filter by plugin — results are live search.</p><div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 mb-4"><p class="text-sm text-amber-300">Migrating will discard downloaded pages and per-chapter reading position on the previous source and cannot be recovered. Read/unread state carries over by chapter number (chapters with number ≤ last read become read).</p></div><form method="get" action="/view/migrate/md/s1" id="migrateForm" class="mb-3"><div class="mb-3"><div class="mb-2"><label class="block text-xs text-neutral-400 mb-1">Search</label><input type="text" id="migrateQ" name="q" value="golden" placeholder="Manga title..." class="w-full bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-700 rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm"></div><div class="mb-2"><label class="block text-xs text-neutral-400 mb-1">Source plugins (select all to search all)</label><div class="grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-2 border border-neutral-700 rounded-md px-3 py-3 bg-neutral-900"><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-100 cursor-pointer select-none"><input type="checkbox" name="pluginIDs" value="p" class="accent-indigo-500 w-4 h-4"><span class="font-medium">Plugin P</span></label></div></div><div class="flex justify-end"><button type="submit" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white rounded-md px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium">Search</button></div></form><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col bg-neutral-900 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-black/40 hover:ring-1 hover:ring-amber-500/60 transition"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-2 left-2 z-10 bg-emerald-500 text-white text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide px-3 py-1 rounded-md shadow-lg shadow-black/50">EXACT</div><img src="/image?pluginID=p&url=https://cdn.test/1.jpg" alt="One" class="w-full aspect-[2/3] object-cover bg-neutral-800" loading="lazy" data-fallback="On"></div><div class="p-3 flex-1 flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium text-sm mb-1 truncate" title="One">One</div><div class="mb-1"><span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2 chapters</span></div><div class="mb-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-300">Plugin P</span></div><form method="post" action="/action/migrate-source/md/s1" class="mt-auto"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value=""><input type="hidden" name="targetPluginID" value="p"><input type="hidden" name="targetMangaID" value="s"><button type="submit" class="w-full bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium">Migrate</button></form></div></div></div>
